+# Pre-staged roadmap for 2026.06.362 (outer-loop, Claude Opus 4.8, 2026-06-07).
+#
+# WHY THIS SHAPE — .361 WAS A NEAR-TOTAL INFRA WASH; .362 RECOVERS IT.
+# .361 set out to PROVE THE VERIFIER EARNS ITS PLACE (north-star §5) and produced
+# only 3 of ~11 artifacts. Two infra failures (NOT science) caused it:
+#   1. exp3904 (the CRITICAL ACCURACY axis / moat scissor) returned
+#      blocked_llama_cpp_inference_failed: the live Qwen3.6-35B GGUF inference path
+#      failed at runtime (CUDA available, model cached, carnot.verify imported — the
+#      inference CALL itself failed under llama_cpp 0.3.23 with full GPU offload).
+#      The moat scissor has now been BLOCKED/INCONCLUSIVE THREE milestones running
+#      (.359 exp3885, .360 exp3895, .361 exp3904), ALWAYS on the live-35B path.
+#   2. exp3905 (cost harness) shipped a POISON TEST
+#      (tests/python/test_cost_instrumented_verification.py asserts duration_s>=60
+#      on a 10-ITEM fixture that only takes 35.8s). That test fails in the conductor
+#      PRE-TEST gate, so EVERY task after it SKIP'd ("1 failed, 105 passed") —
+#      efficiency, cascade, ARC scaffold, facts, FR-11 v25, hardware, AND the
+#      capstone. This is the agent-shipped poison-test cascade (memory
+#      incident_agent_shipped_test_cascade). The 60s adversarial floor is for the
+#      FULL-CORPUS science artifact, NEVER for a 10-item unit-test fixture.
+#
+# .362 = UNBLOCK, then FINISH THE OFFLINE VERIFIER PROOF.
+#   Phase 0  : archive/activate + QUARANTINE the poison test (break the cascade) +
+#              fix the cost-harness fixture assertion. Then a ROBUST, TESTED GGUF
+#              inference harness with a documented fallback chain (the root-cause fix
+#              for exp3904's blocked_llama_cpp_inference_failed) that ALL live-model
+#              tasks reuse — harness-first per the .360/.361 lesson.
+#   Phase 1  : the offline proof, re-run on the hardened harness — ACCURACY (moat
+#              scissor re-gated) + EFFICIENCY (head-to-head, accuracy parity + cost
+#              ratio "parity at Nx cheaper") + the Meta-EBM cascade router.
+#   Phase 2  : the verifier-first ARC-AGI-3 agentic-proof SCAFFOLD (GPU-free, robust,
+#              never ran — sequenced SECOND per north-star §5).
+#   Phase 3  : the LAST disciplined facts graph-grounding retry (retire_if_same).
+#   Phase 4  : FR-11 v25 (research-program.md MANDATE) + hardware continuity + capstone.
+#
+# HARDENING (carried from .356-.361, TIGHTENED for the two .361 failure modes):
+#   1. NO unit-test duration floor on a tiny fixture. The 60s live-floor is asserted
+#      ONLY on the FULL-CORPUS science artifact's duration_s, NEVER inside a unit test
+#      on a <=12-item fixture (the exp3905 poison-test root cause). Fixture tests assert
+#      CORRECTNESS (ratio>1, both run, distinct, AUROC band) — not wall-clock.
+#   2. ROBUST live-model path: every live-model task imports the exp3915 gguf_inference
+#      harness, which (a) runs a 1-token GENERATE smoke before declaring ready, (b) falls
+#      back across cached headline-eligible GGUFs (gemma-4-26B-A4B-it / Qwen3.6-35B /
+#      gemma-4-31B-it), (c) reduces n_gpu_layers on OOM/failure. exp3904 blocked because
+#      no task had this — fixed at the root.
+#   3. NO hard gated_on on the critical path (.340 disk-fallback). Each downstream task
+#      disk-reads its upstream and emits blocked_upstream_* if absent — a skipped upstream
+#      costs ONE task, never a cascade.
+#   4. BARE field emission: every REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELD value is a bare scalar; the
+#      principle: lines guide the agent, NOT a {{value,principle}} wrapper (exp3871 bug).
+#
+# ROUTING: all tasks codex + requires_codex + gpt-5.5 (anti-wipeout; gemini crashes GPU
